Proof.
  (* LPS 727298f3: [akernel] is [akernel_pre /\ akernel_resx]; the recorded proof builds the first
     half (its result type is [akernel_pre_d]), [akernel_resx_main] the second.  [akernel_pre]'s
     first conjunct is over [segments_reserved asegs] (the image's reservations, [ak1]); the
     record was decoded, the list in that one conjunct set from [vm_reserved (m_vmmaps model)] to
     [segments_reserved asegs], and the record compressed again; decoded, the two terms differ
     there only, and [vm_reserved] stays in the conjuncts that read the ledger. *)
  unfold akernel. split; [| exact akernel_resx_main].
